        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world where the boundaries between realities are blurred. Blackwood Manor is not just a place, but a prison for the soul, shattered into fragments of time. Like Daniel, you came here in search of the truth, but found yourself trapped in a terrifying mind game. Your only key to freedom and understanding is an ancient Polaroid camera, capable of capturing the invisible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photograph old paintings, and each developed image will become a bridge to the house's past—to the days when the tragedy was just beginning. But beware: the closer you get to solving the mystery, the more active and aggressive the &quot;Echo&quot; becomes—a ruthless entity dwelling within the walls of the Present, feeding on your fear. Collect journal fragments, solve puzzles, and evade pursuit to assemble the &quot;Sealer&quot; and bring peace to the house... or become its next victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll need to find keys and open locked doors, solve puzzles, and find passages. This is a first-person game with horror elements. Explore the house and its rooms, collect batteries for your flashlight, and solve riddles. The darkness can hide various secrets.</p>",
